        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 890/00, Sleek Solid Brass Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple yet modern in design, this door lever will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting for a very modern look. The Ultra Sleek Leverset fits most standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparations. Omnia's 890 lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Sleek Solid Brass Door Lever is available in several contemporary finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sleek Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 890 Sleek Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/locking-door-bars.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ultra Sleek Leverset",
                "description": "Simple yet modern in design, this door lever will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting for a very modern look. The Ultra Sleek Leverset fits most standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparations. Omnia's 890 lever is avilable in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Sleek Solid Brass Door Lever is available in several contemporary finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia 890 Lever Latchset, OMN-890/00, Omnia contemporary door levers, modern door lever latchsets, Omnia curved door levers, contemporary door handles, solid brass ultra sleek door levers, modern levers, 890/00 Omnia contemporary door levers, Omnia brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, ada compliant levers"
